TI  - Predictive Metabolomic Markers in Early to Mid-pregnancy for Gestational Diabetes Mellitus: A Prospective Test and Validation Study
PY  - 2022
T2  - Diabetes
VL  - 71
IS  - 8
SP  - 1807
EP  - 1817
