TI  - Instituting a Curriculum for Cardio-Obstetrics Subspecialty Fellowship Training
PY  - 2022
T2  - Methodist DeBakey Cardiovascular Journal
VL  - 18
IS  - 3
SP  - 14
EP  - 23
