TI  - Provider Counseling about and Risk Perception for Future Chronic Disease among Women with Gestational Diabetes and Preeclampsia
PY  - 2020
T2  - Journal of Women's Health
VL  - 29
IS  - 9
SP  - 1168
EP  - 1175
