TI  - Long term (>1 year) postpartum glucose tolerance status among Indian women with history of Gestational Diabetes Mellitus (GDM) diagnosed by IADPSG criteria
PY  - 2018
T2  - Diabetes Research and Clinical Practice
VL  - 142
SP  - 154
EP  - 161
