TI  - Maternal serum atrial natriuretic peptide (ANP) and brain-type natriuretic peptide (BNP) levels in gestational diabetes mellitus
PY  - 2016
T2  - Journal of Maternal-Fetal and Neonatal Medicine
VL  - 29
IS  - 15
SP  - 2527
