AB  - The proceedings contain 50 papers. The topics discussed include: rigid and elastic registration for coronary artery IVUS images; research of the assessable method of postpartum hemorrhage; influence of gestational age and time of day in baseline and heart rate variation of fetuses; hemodynamic changes in osteonecrosis treatment of the femoral head with iliac bone flaps pedicled with the lateral femoral circumflex artery ascending branch: a 10-year report; research of gestational diabetes mellitus risk evaluation method; esophageal reconstruction: combined application of muscle tissue flap and inner chitosan tube stent in rabbits; the effect of telehealth systems and satisfaction with health expenditure among patients with metabolic syndrome; 2D biological representations with reduced speckle obtained from two perpendicular ultrasonic arrays; risk diagnosis based on diameter of abdominal aortic aneurysm; a hierarchical two-phase framework for selecting genes in cancer datasets with a neuro-fuzzy system; and a study on the operation of rehabilitation interfaces in active rehabilitation exercises for upper limb hemiplegic patients: interfaces for lateral and bilateral exercises.
