TI  - Pre-pregnancy overweight overtakes Gestational diabetes as a risk factor for subsequent metabolic syndrome
PY  - 2013
T2  - European Journal of Endocrinology
VL  - 169
IS  - 5
SP  - 605
EP  - 611
