TI  - Increased blood pressure in the offspring of diabetic mothers
PY  - 2005
T2  - American Journal of Physiology - Regulatory Integrative and Comparative Physiology
VL  - 288
IS  - 5 57-5
SP  - R1129
EP  - R1133
