TI  - Effect of thiazolidinedione treatment on progression of subclinical atherosclerosis in premenopausal women at high risk for type 2 diabetes
PY  - 2005
T2  - Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism
VL  - 90
IS  - 4
SP  - 1986
