TI  - Unexpected fetal death during pregnancy - A problem of unrecognized fetal disorders during antenatal care?
PY  - 2003
T2  - European Journal of Obstetrics and Gynecology and Reproductive Biology
VL  - 110
IS  - SUPPL.
SP  - S86
EP  - S92
